  "ingredients": [
    "8 cups chopped rhubarb",
    "1 cup sliced fresh strawberries",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "0.75 cup brown sugar",
    "0.75 cup quick-cooking oats",
    "0.75 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 cup butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qHFgFG6niPjz37rtSzbZ-zWZ-1Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233075-strawberry-rhubarb-cobbler-DDMFS-058-step-01-f6eb498da4d54f6da6c0f49a5db2fca0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233075/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine rhubarb, strawberries, white sugar, and 2 tablespoons flour in a bowl; spread into the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-WGsDiLHeP_NIideVdN96isgynM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233075-strawberry-rhubarb-cobbler-DDMFS-059-step-02-837191b9db3c41d896e275ea77f6bbdc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233075/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix brown sugar, oats, 3/4 cup flour, and cinnamon together in a bowl; cut in butter with 2 knives or a pastry blender until mixture resembles coarse crumbs. Sprinkle over rhubarb mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/POqeHDkeZcelZcyrSArz2P4SVjU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/233075-strawberry-rhubarb-cobbler-DDMFS-060-step-03-e32adc43de844714b2148f1c125c1626.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/233075/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cobbler is bubbling and lightly browned, about 45 minutes. Serve hot or cold.",
      "section": null,
